[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695709039","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2695709039","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2695709039,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6grUFv","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T22:27:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T22:27:30Z","body":"Could you explain what the actual problem is? I assume there's a fault in the code but you don't link to the code you're referring to, and as an issue triager I'm not immediately intimate with what `_remove_lock_file` is, what it's supposed to do and why the absence of calling it would be a problem.\n\nSure, I could spend some time researching it but this is the information a bug report should convey so that contributors can understand a problem (what was expected, what was found, what is the consequence of it) and fix it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695709039/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695768371","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2695768371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2695768371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6grikz","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T23:05:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T23:07:49Z","body":"The problem is that the lock file is left in place, which leads to a prompt the next time you open the editor. This shouldn't happen.\n[This](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blame/9f68a816599412c56a4626dd6c47244ebc65ed1f/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1219) is the code I'm referring to.\n`_remove_lock_file` removes the lock file at (on windows) `%appdata%\\Godot\\app_userdata\\PROJECT_NAME\\.recovery_mode_lock`\nIt is used to determine if you should launch in recovery mode.\nThe absence of calling is a problem, because it's indicative of needing to launch in recovery mode.\n\nWhat was expected:\n`_remove_lock_file` is called\nWhat was found:\n`_remove_lock_file` was not called\nConsequence\nThe lock file is not removed, causing an erroneous popup on the next run.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695768371/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695775705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2695775705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2695775705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6grkXZ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T23:10:48Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T23:10:48Z","body":"CC @rsubtil ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695775705/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695792397","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2695792397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2695792397,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6grocN","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T23:22:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T23:22:41Z","body":"After staring at this long enough, I wonder if the other timers in this file are even successful. They aren't causing any issues for me presently, but perhaps this is indicative of a bigger issue? In general I wish these timers had more context as to why they're needed and why they have the values they have.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695792397/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695873426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2695873426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2695873426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gr8OS","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T00:23:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T00:23:55Z","body":"Note that removing the lock file should only be done when running the editor, not when running the project directly from the command line or project manager.\n\nThis means `--headless` alone should not remove the lock file, but `--headless --editor`, `--headless --import` or `--headless --export` should (`--import` and `--export` both imply `--editor`).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695873426/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697402403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2697402403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2697402403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gxxgj","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T12:27:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T12:27:44Z","body":"I've just retested it, and the behavior looks \"mostly\" correct to me on `--headless` mode.\n\nWhen running simply with `--headless` mode, no lock file is created nor removed. This is intended, because this behavior can only occur on editor mode, as @Calinou said. And whenever I do so (`--editor/--import/--export`), the lock file is created, and then eventually deleted. I can't replicate your situation where the timer apparently fails to trigger. I tested this on Linux, so could this be a OS specific bug? Can you provide exact commands of how you're finding this issue?\n\nHowever, when using `--import/--export`, it can happen that each process is finished before the timer is triggered, and the lock file persists after the engine finishes. I can replicate this quite easily on an empty project (since it doesn't have much content to import), so I'll have to account for this scenario too then 👍.\n\nLastly, to answer your question as to why a timer was used an not a `call_deferred`, it has to do with the order some of these components run. `@tool` scripts run on the next frame, so the first solution used a `call_deferred`. But this fails to catch some scenarios such as `queue_free`ing a editor node, which is delayed another frame. I then added a 2 frame delay, but the issue with this is that the problem just keeps going. Scripts can always be crafted in a way to cause reliable crashes that recovery mode cannot detect, so in the end I chose to instead use a time frame of 1 second instead of engine frames, which starts after the initial import process. It's not a perfect solution, and is essentially a compromise I reached.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697402403/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697416478","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2697416478","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2697416478,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gx08e","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T12:32:56Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T12:32:56Z","body":"It seems https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103564 is also related to this, and also happening on Windows, so I'll need to investigate it in there. I can only get a Windows machine on a couple of days though, but once I can test it I'll share my findings.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697416478/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698181398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2698181398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2698181398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g0vsW","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T16:08:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T16:08:08Z","body":"That other issue sounds exactly like my story. I put debug prints in the engine and every time the timer is created, but the method it's supposed to call is not. I run with both `--import` and `--export` and see the same result in both cases. The lock file is created each run, but not removed. When importing I have `godot --import --headless --verbose --quit` I can try running `--import` when I get back to work without `--quit` to see if that makes a difference.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698181398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698201109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2698201109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2698201109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g00gV","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T16:14:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T16:14:22Z","body":"`--quit` quits after the first process iteration, so that might be why. Try using a larger number of iterations to wait before quitting with `--quit-after N` where N is the number of iterations to wait (start with `2`). Eventually, you should find a large enough value that allows the lock file to be removed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698201109/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708214773","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2708214773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2708214773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hbBP1","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T11:13:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T11:13:55Z","body":"Seems like the issue is specific to `--export/--import`, and not Windows specific as I was assuming. The other report was also clarified and had the same issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708214773/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2790742631","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103528#issuecomment-2790742631","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103528","id":2790742631,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mV1pn","user":{"login":"VojtaStruhar","id":49688205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Njg4MjA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49688205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar","html_url":"https://github.com/VojtaStruhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/repos","eve